{
  "slug": "learning-framework",
  "name": "Learning Framework",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Adult learning & knowledge management meta-router — 12 cognitive science-based frameworks (Zettelkasten, PARA/Second Brain, Evergreen Notes, Spaced Repetition, Active Recall, Feynman Technique with AI-as-feedback-channel workflows, Interleaving, Deliberate Practice, Chunking, Deep Work, Pomodoro, Metalearning). Based on Ebbinghaus, Roediger-Karpicke, Bjork, Ericsson research. Korean learner context (수능/CSAT, 공무원 civil service exams, CPA, 회독 repeated-reading culture). Invoke /learn.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `learn` (Adult learning & knowledge management meta-router — auto-selects from 12 cognitive-science / educational-psychology frameworks (Zettelkasten, Spaced Repetition, Active…), `active-recall` (Active Recall (Retrieval Practice) — The testing effect by Roediger·Karpicke), `chunking` (Chunking — Miller's 7±2 short-term memory constraint, expert chunk perception, and chunk-size calibration in learning design), `deep-work` (Deep Work — Cal Newport), `deliberate-practice` (Deliberate Practice — Anders Ericsson's theory of deliberate practice), `evergreen-notes` (Evergreen Notes — Andy Matuschak's digital note-taking practice), `feynman-technique` (Feynman Technique — a method of revealing gaps in understanding by explaining to a beginner), `interleaving` (Interleaving — mixing multiple topics and problem types during study), and 5 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install learning-framework@claude-community` from `ironyjk/learning-framework`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
